  "title": "Cubiculum Obscurum",
  "storyCode": "2-9",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a0c05d63cffd214c3c02815d3c7ea0116ba36cd8d5476a1f712e61f402ad8a0b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Why are there so many Reunion members here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Aaargh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Am I the only one who thinks that there are more and more of them coming?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Ugh!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Nope. It's clear that they have more reinforcements coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Curses... We still haven't had a chance to avenge them yet...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "They ended up finding us first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Franka, look."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Over by the east exit, I think those are Reunion's casters hiding over there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "A lot of them approaching from the central passage as well as from the high-rises to our sides..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "...They're trying to sneak over while pretending like they haven't noticed us yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "But, we're on top of the roof..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "No matter how many they send at us, they'll be doomed if they get knocked over..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "I feel like they're insulting my intelligence by launching an attack as brazen as this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Is Reunion launching their offensive?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "All operators, regroup!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Wait, I think I just saw..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Isn't that the Reunion commander we ran into earlier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "... Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "Did you turn her over to Lungmen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "(Franka, we have to hold back the Reunion forces first!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "(We'll have to make our way down once they're too afraid to keep attacking us!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "(We'll have to spread out the battlefield for now!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "(Understood. We'll be doing a hit and run then!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "What does it have to do with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "...How dare you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "My comrades, attaaack!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
